ools: An R package for analyzing finite mixture models. J Stat Softw. 2009;32:1&#8211;29. doi: 10.18637/jss.v032.i06.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.18637/jss.v032.i06</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Rancati G, Moffat J, Typas A, Pavelka N. Emerging and evolving concepts in gene essentiality. Nat Rev Genet. 2018;19:34&#8211;49. doi: 10.1038/nrg.2017.74.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/nrg.2017.74</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">29033457</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Takahashi K, Yamanaka S. Induction of pluripotent stem cells from mouse embryonic and adult fibroblast cultures by defined factors. Cell. 2006;126:663&#8211;676. doi: 10.1016/j.cell.2006.07.024.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.cell.2006.07.024</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">16904174</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Velimezi G, Robinson-Garcia L, Mu&#241;oz-Mart&#237;nez F, Wiegant WW, Ferreira da Silva J, Owusu M, et al. Map of synthetic rescue interactions for the Fanconi anemia DNA repair pathway identifies USP48. Nat Commun. 2018;9:2280. doi: 10.1038/s41467-018-04649-z.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/s41467-018-04649-z</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC5996029</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">29891926</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Moder M, Velimezi G, Owusu M, Mazouzi A, Wiedner M, Ferreira da Silva J, et al. Parallel genome-wide screens identify synthetic viable interactions between the BLM helicase complex and Fanconi anemia. Nat Commun. 2017;8:1238. doi: 10.1038/s41467-017-01439-x.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/s41467-017-01439-x</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC5663702</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">29089570</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Yilmaz A, Peretz M, Aharony A, Sagi I, Benvenisty N. Defining